      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170514\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170514\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>The fire-resistance rating of masonry walls shall be based upon the equivalent thickness as calculated in accordance with this section. The calculation shall take into account finishes applied to the wall and airspaces between wythes in multi-wythe construction.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170515\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170515\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><a name=\"JD_BCTable722.4.1(1)\" id=\"JD_BCTable722.4.1(1)\" title=\"BC Table 722.4.1(1)\"><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Table 722.4.1(1)<br><\/br>Fire-Resistance Periods of Clay Masonry Walls<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170516\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170516\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div style=\"margin-bottom=10pt\">&#160;<div class=\"xsl-table\">",
